[Options]

[A.]
                                             <i>~[IsunCannon.3]</i> GAIN POWER <i>~[IrainCannon.C3]</i><br>
<i>But, master Sun Lord, it's not fair... 2 against 1... I need help!<br>
                                                                                  --mosquito
<br>
<i>Enough, you Cowardly Clump of drivel. I grow tired of your incessant whining..<br>
                                                                                  --Sun God</i><br><br>
<p>
Wow!, there seems to be no stopping you... The sun God, although against
his better judgement, bestows upon you the rank of WART<br>
(<i><h2>W</i/h2>arriors <i><h2>A</i/h2>gainst <i><h2>R</i/h2>ebellious <i><h2>T</i/h2>rainees).

<p>
The Rain Fury has asked for your help in squashing some rebellious rain trainees.<br>
Succeed, and he promises to grant you the power of rain<br>

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0


